      "writtenOn": "2020-11-16T22:10:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I should not use \"NACK\". The VDM:Attention has no response. I will change the terminology.\n\nTrogdor is like (b). It responses the pin selection but defers the pin configuration until HPD is high. When receives a HPD high, the TCPC mux and the extra DP mux are configured before EC regenerates the HPD signal to SoC.\n\nOn the second monitor port, it ignores the HPD signal. The monitor may keep sending some HPD IRQs and some HPD low and high pulses and then timeout.",
      "parentUuid": "fc88c0a8_292187ff",
